      "comment": "Mikoshi Chiyo: The beast of sin",
      "content": "The beast that swallowed Chiyo had a tiger's body and a serpent's tail and came from beyond this world. She tore it apart from within, but the darkness inside it marked her. The wiki notes it may be a nue, a monstrous creature of Japanese folklore; canon does not name it.",
