      "comment": "Mikoshi Chiyo: Chiyo's sons",
      "content": "Michihiro, her eldest son, secluded himself in a village from shame and was later renamed Iwakura by the tengu Teruyo. Nagamasa, her foster son, became an inspector at Tatarasuna and served the Shogunate to restore the Mikoshi name. See their own entries.",
